         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The MC79L00A Series negative voltage regulators are&#xD;&#xA;inexpensive, easy-to-use devices suitable for numerous applications&#xD;&#xA;requiring up to 100 mA.</rdf:li>
